      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like there’s nothing left. everything i worked for, all those years of studying and the research, it’s just gone. like i was only ever defined by that stuff. now that it’s ruined, i’m just... a hollow shell. i don't even recognize myself anymore. there's no point to any of it.",
